      "rank": 0,
      "embedding_idx": 3,
      "text": "This app is very poor and has extremely limited features. Basically, it just puts a bad wrinkle filter and bushy hair on a photo, no AI or face sculpting. I was trying to amuse my 5 yr old, she said 'this app sucks' and she was right."
