    {
      "rank": 1,
      "embedding_idx": 0,
      "text": "Recommend not to install what I think is a useless app, it shows a photo that you decorate with silly moustaches, glasses etc on.  Total waste of time, I've already uninstalled it.  You asked me to update my review of this app, sorry, my opinion is unchanged, I can do that in photoshop without installing this app."
    },
